Hi Charlotte,

There are three possible solutions here:
If your timestamps are formatted well enough, then timeformat="auto" may work
Get them into POSIX format, which you can infer from the buffalo data from head(buffalo[[1]])
Provide an appropriate timeformat argument from documentation and examples in help("strptime")
Best,
Chris

